        "name": "USN-6042-2",
        "description": "USN-6042-1 fixed a vulnerability in Cloud-init. The update introduced a regression on Ubuntu 20.04 LTS resulting in a possible loss of networking. This update fixes the problem.  We apologize for the inconvenience.  Original advisory details:   James Golovich discovered that sensitive data could be exposed in logs. An  attacker could use this information to find hashed passwords and possibly  escalate their privilege.",
